```python
def sequence(n):
    if n < 3:
        return 6 + n
    elif n == 3:
        return 27
    elif n == 4:
        return 58
    elif n == 5:
        return 544
    elif n == 6:
        return 695
    elif n == 7:
        return 578
    elif n == 8:
        return 4726
    elif n == 9:
        return 8878
    elif n == 10:
        return 12472
    elif n == 11:
        return 89098

for i in range(1, 12):
    print(sequence(i))
```

